\newlabel{fig:kernels}{{1}{3}{Excerpts from the unchanged source implementations. Signatures, assertions, and the NEON tail are omitted here; the complete source files are retained in the draft package. The RVV comments are omitted without changing executable statements. \texttt {batch} counts bytes, and \texttt {n} counts float elements. The proof must cover the complete functions, including the omitted tail}{figure.caption.1}{}}
